@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Inspect Dapr subscriptions manifest (discovered by Dapr sidecar at startup)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dapr/subscribe

### 2. Publish valid invoice (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/publish/invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-2026-001",
  "customerId": "ACME-CORP",
  "totalAmount": 1250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 3. Publish invalid invoice (Drop - non-positive amount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/publish/invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-2026-002",
  "customerId": "ACME-CORP",
  "totalAmount": 0.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 4. Direct HTTP push test (simulating Dapr sidecar calling the handler route)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/invoices
Content-Type: application/cloudevents+json

{
  "specversion": "1.0",
  "id": "ce-msg-001",
  "source": "billing-service",
  "type": "com.dapr.invoice.generated",
  "pubsubname": "pubsub",
  "topic": "invoices",
  "data": {
    "invoiceId": "INV-2026-003",
    "customerId": "BETA-LLC",
    "totalAmount": 450.75,
    "currency": "USD",
    "dueDate": "2026-06-15T00:00:00Z"
  }
}
